      "author_name" : "Dobby",
      "content" : {
        "rendered" : "<p>Easy one to use on a real trip. Two midweek nights in Boston or DC clear $600 without trying, esp around conference season. Just remember portal bookings usually don’t earn hotel points or elite nights, so if you’re chasing status the $100 has to beat that. Price the exact room on the hotel’s own site first and only use the portal if it’s still ahead after the $100!</p>\n"
